WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.249 --> 00:00:02.582
(screaming)

00:00:05.387 --> 00:00:07.787
- We're gonna take
every flavor of cake mix

00:00:07.787 --> 00:00:11.454
and we're gonna make
it into one giant cake.

00:00:11.601 --> 00:00:13.518
You're Dr. Frankencake.

00:00:14.441 --> 00:00:17.941
And the cake is called Frankencake's cake.

00:00:19.565 --> 00:00:21.482
- Mm hm.
- It's a cake!

00:00:22.341 --> 00:00:23.258
- 18 cakes.

00:00:23.514 --> 00:00:24.764
- 16 frostings.

00:00:25.836 --> 00:00:28.959
- One delicious thing.
- One delicious thing.

00:00:28.959 --> 00:00:29.792
- Maybe.

00:00:29.949 --> 00:00:32.442
- We got some interesting
flavors, we got some carrot.

00:00:32.442 --> 00:00:33.768
- Mm hm, we got some spice.

00:00:33.768 --> 00:00:34.851
- Angel food.

00:00:34.854 --> 00:00:36.045
- That's gonna mess stuff up.

00:00:36.045 --> 00:00:37.377
We have to take the big bowls and put

00:00:37.377 --> 00:00:40.413
a little bit of all 18 in a few of them.

00:00:40.413 --> 00:00:42.469
- And then we put, we fill up these,

00:00:42.469 --> 00:00:43.793
and we're gonna, like, stack them

00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:47.793
and it's gonna be a giant
six-layer Frankencake.

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:49.339
I wanna start with Funfetti.

00:00:49.339 --> 00:00:50.172
My fave.

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:52.954
- You know what's a bummer? I can't like,

00:00:52.954 --> 00:00:55.204
test any of the raw batter.

00:00:56.025 --> 00:00:58.225
- Just do it when she's not
looking, she won't notice.

00:00:58.225 --> 00:01:00.309
- [Kate] I wanna keep it
on one side, you know?

00:01:00.309 --> 00:01:01.892
- Red velvet, done.

00:01:03.276 --> 00:01:04.927
As much as I want this to taste good,

00:01:04.927 --> 00:01:06.337
I'm going to put some lemon in this.

00:01:06.337 --> 00:01:07.538
- Lemon tastes good all the time.

00:01:07.538 --> 00:01:09.643
Squirt of lemon, mm, fancy now.

00:01:09.643 --> 00:01:11.131
- We're at six, we're a
third of the way there.

00:01:11.131 --> 00:01:12.298
- [Kate] Geez.

00:01:12.494 --> 00:01:13.715
- Whoa, it's like melting it.

00:01:13.715 --> 00:01:14.548
- [Kate] Uh oh.

00:01:14.548 --> 00:01:15.748
- [Alex] Weird.

00:01:15.748 --> 00:01:16.894
How do you swirl it?

00:01:16.894 --> 00:01:18.311
- You guys drive.

00:01:18.462 --> 00:01:20.334
I don't know, I don't know what to do.

00:01:20.334 --> 00:01:22.831
- [Alex] Oh, now we're smooshin'.

00:01:22.831 --> 00:01:23.893
Now we're swirlin'.

00:01:23.893 --> 00:01:25.170
- That looks nice.

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:26.257
That's beautiful.

00:01:26.257 --> 00:01:28.386
- Like that foam is just, hmmm.

00:01:28.386 --> 00:01:31.186
- [Kate] I know, it's
like really bubbling.

00:01:31.186 --> 00:01:32.379
- This could be a sitcom.

00:01:32.379 --> 00:01:34.212
Kate, two cakes again?

00:01:36.549 --> 00:01:38.466
- No, I'm baking three.

00:01:40.648 --> 00:01:41.481
- Awwwwww.

00:01:43.433 --> 00:01:45.277
10 mixes down, eight more to go.

00:01:45.277 --> 00:01:47.311
- I'm gonna throw in this packet

00:01:47.311 --> 00:01:49.318
of carrots and raisins into the mix.

00:01:49.318 --> 00:01:50.151
- Don't.

00:01:50.292 --> 00:01:51.651
- I have to do some weird stuff.

00:01:51.651 --> 00:01:52.747
I need to get hot water

00:01:52.747 --> 00:01:55.997
and put my carrots and raisins into it.

00:01:57.625 --> 00:01:59.958
- Ugh, god I'm losing steam.

00:02:00.102 --> 00:02:01.793
(screams)

00:02:01.793 --> 00:02:03.001
- What happened?

00:02:03.001 --> 00:02:03.984
(screams)

00:02:03.984 --> 00:02:05.439
- Don't worry, I'm just freaking out.

00:02:05.439 --> 00:02:06.853
- You're just freaking out, no big deal.

00:02:06.853 --> 00:02:09.020
It's making cake too long.

00:02:12.155 --> 00:02:12.988
Oh no!

00:02:14.135 --> 00:02:14.968
Sorry.

00:02:15.035 --> 00:02:16.613
(laughing)

00:02:16.613 --> 00:02:17.780
- Swirl it up.

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:23.483
Whoa.

00:02:24.182 --> 00:02:26.767
- Whoa delicious, whoa that flavor?

00:02:26.767 --> 00:02:27.934
- Just like...

00:02:28.388 --> 00:02:29.221
Yeah.

00:02:30.193 --> 00:02:32.077
You can just set that right on the ground.

00:02:32.077 --> 00:02:33.134
(laughs)

00:02:33.134 --> 00:02:35.884
- Don't step on that by accident.

00:02:37.737 --> 00:02:39.815
(bell ringing)

00:02:39.815 --> 00:02:41.065
- [Kate] Ohhhh.

00:02:41.727 --> 00:02:43.924
- [Man] They have a bit
of a jiggle to them.

00:02:43.924 --> 00:02:44.757
- Hi.

00:02:45.645 --> 00:02:48.228
- Cover the pans with tin foil,

00:02:48.847 --> 00:02:50.390
so they don't keep browning on top.

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:51.394
- [Kate] Okay.

00:02:51.394 --> 00:02:53.947
- And I would lower the temperature,

00:02:53.947 --> 00:02:55.236
and just let them go in there longer.

00:02:55.236 --> 00:02:56.215
You don't want to burn.

00:02:56.215 --> 00:02:57.048
Good luck.

00:02:57.197 --> 00:02:59.864
- I predict it's gonna be great.

00:03:03.632 --> 00:03:06.882
We've been baking cake for seven hours.

00:03:08.316 --> 00:03:09.149
- Yeah.

00:03:10.229 --> 00:03:12.217
- We made cake.
- We made 'em.

00:03:12.217 --> 00:03:13.406
It actually smells pretty good.

00:03:13.406 --> 00:03:16.906
Now we're gonna stack these and frost 'em.

00:03:17.654 --> 00:03:19.287
- It's gonna make things
look much prettier

00:03:19.287 --> 00:03:20.646
than they are currently.

00:03:20.646 --> 00:03:21.750
Let's cover this up right away.

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:22.949
Oh great it's beautiful.

00:03:22.949 --> 00:03:23.782
- Whoa!

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:26.037
- Good job.

00:03:26.415 --> 00:03:27.677
(laughing)

00:03:27.677 --> 00:03:28.510
- Oh no.

00:03:30.199 --> 00:03:32.288
At least we're consistent
with burning it on the sides.

00:03:32.288 --> 00:03:34.871
(upbeat music)

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:38.698
As much as this cake has hurt me,

00:03:38.698 --> 00:03:39.989
I feel a little bit proud.

00:03:39.989 --> 00:03:40.822
Wow.

00:03:40.981 --> 00:03:42.064
Look at this.

00:03:42.656 --> 00:03:43.989
This is amazing.

00:03:44.258 --> 00:03:46.078
Get some lemon in there.

00:03:46.078 --> 00:03:47.204
Enjoy the party lemon.

00:03:47.204 --> 00:03:48.643
This is becoming an art piece.

00:03:48.643 --> 00:03:49.476
Oh my God.

00:03:51.033 --> 00:03:51.866
Oh my God.

00:03:52.688 --> 00:03:53.771
I'm so proud.

00:03:54.214 --> 00:03:56.797
(upbeat music)

00:04:02.521 --> 00:04:03.354
- (beep)

00:04:03.354 --> 00:04:04.439
(laughs)

00:04:04.439 --> 00:04:05.607
- [Woman] It's cute.

00:04:05.607 --> 00:04:07.098
(laughs)

00:04:07.098 --> 00:04:08.439
- It's really very good cake.

00:04:08.439 --> 00:04:09.554
- Very unique flavor.

00:04:09.554 --> 00:04:10.978
- Cinnamony friendship.

00:04:10.978 --> 00:04:13.870
- It's like a peanut butter apple cake.

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:15.607
- Kinda like licorice.

00:04:15.607 --> 00:04:17.463
- Kinda tastes like banana peanut butter.

00:04:17.463 --> 00:04:19.130
